 Utiliza\nEstrategias \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; FerramentasComplementares : Apoia\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="abWDtaht0BZKqcW3iniw-1">
